OL,3,GNEWSAHow Clarkson's Farm is attracting
OL,4,Ayoung people to farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from Lancashire has
OL,7,Fdescribed how Clarkson's Farm inspired
OL,8,Fher to pursue a career in agriculture.
OL,10,FEllie, 17, has a farming background,
OL,11,Fwith her grandparents running a dairy
OL,12,Ffarm near Garstang and her family
OL,13,Fkeeping sheep and cattle at home.
OL,15,FShe had planned to take A-levels and
OL,16,Fpursue a different career, but instead
OL,17,Fchose to study farming at college after
OL,18,Fwatching the Jeremy Clarkson programme,
OL,19,Fwhich she said highlighted the
OL,20,Fimportance of the industry.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
