OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow Clarkson's Farm is attracting
OL,4,Ayoung people to farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllie is one of a growing number of
OL,7,Fyoung people choosing a career in
OL,8,Ffarming. Myerscough College said
OL,9,Fapplications for its agriculture
OL,10,Fcourses had risen by 30%, a trend it
OL,11,Fattributes in part to the "Clarkson
OL,12,FEffect".
